    "translation": "Read di passage and answer. \"Dear Mr. Kim, I am writing to ask about the swimming class on Saturday. Last week, the class was cancelled because of heavy rain. Could you tell me if it will be held this Saturday? Thank you. Best regards, Hana\" Question: Who write di message?",
